{"chapter": "criteria", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "05XM", "placeholders": {"ACCENT_0001": "\\'e", "ACCENT_0002": "\\'e", "MATH_0001": "$\\mathcal{Y}' = \\mathcal{Y}$", "MATH_0002": "$H = \\text{id}_\\mathcal{Y}$", "MATH_0003": "$G$", "MATH_0004": "$\\mathcal{H}_d(\\mathcal{X}'/\\mathcal{Y}) \\to\n\\mathcal{H}_d(\\mathcal{X}/\\mathcal{Y})$", "MATH_0005": "$G$", "MATH_0006": "$\\mathcal{H}_d(\\mathcal{X}'/\\mathcal{Y}) \\to\n\\mathcal{H}_d(\\mathcal{X}/\\mathcal{Y})$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{lemma-map-hilbert}", "STRUCT_0001": "\\begin{enumerate}", "STRUCT_0002": "\\item", "STRUCT_0003": "\\item", "STRUCT_0004": "\\end{enumerate}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-etale-covering-hilbert}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:9b33e1fea3e1dd0e3b292c7b8579deb4772e381d7aa786b3e40c8d4a71ce22ff", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:64a473746bac8e7c42f2740d8e94c6a1bf9d7143d7e525afd94a0a7b0b0e0e73", "source_text": "In the situation of\nLemma <REF_0001>\nassume\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> <MATH_0001> and <MATH_0002>,\n<STRUCT_0003> <MATH_0003> is representable by algebraic spaces and <ACCENT_0001>tale.\n<STRUCT_0004>\nThen <MATH_0004> is representable by\nalgebraic spaces and <ACCENT_0002>tale.\nIf <MATH_0005> is also surjective, then\n<MATH_0006> is surjective.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:6adb15195343287902880056db708cf0dd1ef16c2dcd815d4df2f5284b9f258f", "unit_id": "tag:05YG:statement"}
{"chapter": "criteria", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "05XM", "placeholders": {"ACCENT_0001": "\\'e", "ACCENT_0002": "\\'e", "ACCENT_0003": "\\'e", "ACCENT_0004": "\\'e", "MATH_0001": "$U$", "MATH_0002": "$\\xi = (U, Z, y, x, \\alpha)$", "MATH_0003": "$\\mathcal{H}_d(\\mathcal{X}/\\mathcal{Y})$", "MATH_0004": "$U$", "MATH_0005": "$2$", "MATH_0006": "\\begin{equation}\n\\label{equation-to-show}\n(\\Sch/U)_{fppf}\n\\times_{\\xi, \\mathcal{H}_d(\\mathcal{X}/\\mathcal{Y})}\n\\mathcal{H}_d(\\mathcal{X}'/\\mathcal{Y})\n\\end{equation}", "MATH_0007": "$U$", "MATH_0008": "$U'$", "MATH_0009": "$x'$", "MATH_0010": "$\\mathcal{X}'$", "MATH_0011": "$Z_{U'}$", "MATH_0012": "$G(x') \\cong x|_{Z_{U'}}$", "MATH_0013": "$2$", "MATH_0014": "$$\n(\\Sch/Z)_{fppf} \\times_{x, \\mathcal{X}} \\mathcal{X}'\n$$", "MATH_0015": "$W$", "MATH_0016": "$W \\to Z$", "MATH_0017": "$F$", "MATH_0018": "$W \\to Z$", "MATH_0019": "$U$", "MATH_0020": "$F \\to U$", "MATH_0021": "$\\mathcal{H}_d(\\mathcal{X}'/\\mathcal{Y}) \\to\n\\mathcal{H}_d(\\mathcal{X}/\\mathcal{Y})$", "MATH_0022": "$\\mathcal{X}' \\to \\mathcal{X}$", "MATH_0023": "$W \\to Z$", "MATH_0024": "$F \\to U$", "MATH_0025": "$\\mathcal{H}_d(\\mathcal{X}'/\\mathcal{Y}) \\to\n\\mathcal{H}_d(\\mathcal{X}/\\mathcal{Y})$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{equation-to-show}", "REF_0002": "\\ref{lemma-space-of-sections}", "REF_0003": "\\ref{lemma-surjection-space-of-sections}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:c11a6f567612f4dda704504b862c146cc80459c60bac7be3bfd95fbda69cb065", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:5839279d0c72371a88a9b0ef3dcee7fa0ee3a3a5539ec9193d2851e872a9d6d6", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a scheme and let <MATH_0002> be an object of\n<MATH_0003> over <MATH_0004>.\nWe have to prove that the <MATH_0005>-fibre product\n<MATH_0006>\nis representable by an algebraic space <ACCENT_0001>tale over <MATH_0007>.\nAn object of this over <MATH_0008> corresponds to an object\n<MATH_0009> in the fibre category of <MATH_0010> over <MATH_0011>\nsuch that <MATH_0012>.\nBy assumption the <MATH_0013>-fibre product\n<MATH_0014>\nis representable by an algebraic space <MATH_0015> such that the projection\n<MATH_0016> is <ACCENT_0002>tale. Then (<REF_0001>)\nis representable by the algebraic space <MATH_0017> parametrizing sections of\n<MATH_0018> over <MATH_0019> introduced in\nLemma <REF_0002>.\nSince <MATH_0020> is <ACCENT_0003>tale we conclude that\n<MATH_0021> is representable by\nalgebraic spaces and <ACCENT_0004>tale.\nFinally, if <MATH_0022> is surjective also,\nthen <MATH_0023> is surjective, and hence <MATH_0024> is surjective by\nLemma <REF_0003>.\nThus in this case\n<MATH_0025> is also surjective.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:ce1626421b3cef478d327a10083387b984fb1e881102ab014798cb66a59b8f00", "unit_id": "tag:05YG:proof"}
{"chapter": "criteria", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "05XM", "placeholders": {"ACCENT_0001": "\\'e", "ACCENT_0002": "\\'e", "MATH_0001": "$G$", "MATH_0002": "$H$", "MATH_0003": "$\\mathcal{H}_d(\\mathcal{X}'/\\mathcal{Y}') \\to\n\\mathcal{H}_d(\\mathcal{X}/\\mathcal{Y})$", "MATH_0004": "$H$", "MATH_0005": "$\\mathcal{X}' \\to \\mathcal{Y}' \\times_\\mathcal{Y} \\mathcal{X}$", "MATH_0006": "$\\mathcal{H}_d(\\mathcal{X}'/\\mathcal{Y}') \\to\n\\mathcal{H}_d(\\mathcal{X}/\\mathcal{Y})$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{lemma-map-hilbert}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-etale-map-hilbert}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:4636fb0ad80ae36f8644877830c8bc4d56e818b193a0f247cd3601b9083693cd", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:6d7b5fc79b56ba48954b5884923073d28baeee6c1d2632384bf88a416eae9c3a", "source_text": "In the situation of\nLemma <REF_0001>.\nAssume that <MATH_0001>, <MATH_0002> are representable by algebraic spaces and <ACCENT_0001>tale.\nThen <MATH_0003> is representable by\nalgebraic spaces and <ACCENT_0002>tale.\nIf also <MATH_0004> is surjective and the induced functor\n<MATH_0005>\nis surjective, then\n<MATH_0006> is surjective.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:cb09ca34a721652920cb0fa6ca5f4f0d1752ac96aa0530221c70284f1c14c49d", "unit_id": "tag:05XS:statement"}
